# Error code catalog

This file is the canonical human-readable reference for validation/governance codes.

- Machine-readable mapping (`code -> rule_ids`, blocking) lives in `.agents/rules/_manifest.yml` under `validation.checks`.
- Runtime emitters live in `tooling/scripts/**`.

## Validation and governance codes

| Code | Blocking | Meaning | Primary rule sources |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `TOK03` | yes | Forbidden token format (`VariableID:*` or equivalent). | `prohibited-patterns` |
| `LINK01` | yes | Overview/index contract failed. | `overview-components-canonical-list` |
| `LINK02` | yes | Components overview canonical list format/order failed. | `overview-components-canonical-list` |
| `GAP00` | no | Gaps contract check skipped due to missing linked spec. | `gaps-contract` |
| `GAP01` | yes | `## Gaps / TBD` section contract invalid/missing/mismatched. | `gaps-contract` |
| `GAP02` | yes | Ready spec contains unresolved gaps. | `gaps-contract` |
| `SLOT01` | yes | Invalid skill slot contract (typed inputs/outputs). | `skill-input-output-contract`, `skill-versioning` |
| `VER01` | yes | Versioning contract violation for spec/markdown metadata. | `component-versioning` |
| `UI01` | yes | UI layer boundary/import direction violation. | `ui-architecture-boundaries` |
| `UI02` | yes | UI token/style contract violation (hardcoded colors, portal misuse, etc.). | `ui-style-contract` |
| `UI03` | yes | UI component governance violation (CVA/cn/forwardRef, registry discipline, or orphan policy). | `ui-component-governance` |

## Maintenance rule

Whenever a new validation/governance code is introduced (or semantics change), update:

1. `.agents/rules/_manifest.yml` -> `validation.checks`
2. this file (`error-codes.mdc`)
3. emitter implementation in `tooling/scripts/**`
